CHAPTER.VERS:
Is it nothing to you

          {+}
        , all you

          {+}
         who pass by? Look, and see if there is any sorrow like my sorrow, which is brought on me, With which Yahweh has afflicted [me] in the day of his fierce anger.

Yahweh is righteous; for I have rebelled against his commandment: Hear, I pray you

          {+}
        , all you

          {+}
         peoples, and look at my sorrow: My virgins and my young men have gone into captivity.
